WEBVTT

00:16:28.790 --> 00:16:30.790
onima koji imaju stav sličan mom.

00:16:31.596 --> 00:16:35.240
Broj jedan: prestanite sa preokupiranošću
timskim radom.

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:36.730
Prosto, prestanite.

00:16:36.730 --> 00:16:39.810
(Smeh)

00:16:39.816 --> 00:16:41.000
Hvala.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.000
(Aplauz)

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:46.480
Želim da jasno iznesem svoje stavove,

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:49.336
jer zaista verujem da naša radna sredina
treba da promoviše

00:16:49.336 --> 00:16:52.517
kulture neobaveznih razgovora,

00:16:52.517 --> 00:16:56.170
prijatnu atmosferu gde se ljudi okupe
i spontano razmene ideje.

00:16:56.170 --> 00:16:57.508
To je odlično.

00:16:57.508 --> 00:16:59.970
To prija i introvertnim
i ekstrovertnim osobama.

00:16:59.970 --> 00:17:02.330
Ali potrebno nam je više privatnosti
i slobode,